  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds CC034: flags a ParallelOptions created without a CancellationToken while one is in scope, with a code fix that adds CancellationToken = token to the object initializer. ParallelOptions.CancellationToken is the only way to cancel a Parallel loop, and CC002 structurally cannot see the omission — it matches calls with token-accepting overloads, whereas here the token is a property in an object initializer and Parallel.ForEach has no token overload at all. Fires only when a token is in scope, and stays quiet when the token is assigned afterwards. 34 diagnostics.",
